    <description>A screw-propelled Rukaya fire-support mechanoid armed with a rapid autocannon turret. It sweeps open ground with heavy bursts and doubles as close-in air defense.</description>
    <!-- 中文翻译：装备高射速自动机炮的螺旋推进式卢卡娅火力支援机械体，擅长以密集连射压制开阔地带的步兵，并兼顾近程防空。 -->
